## 1.5 NEW schema/code gaps discovered while building
- [x] **CNIC PLAINTEXT → FIXED 2026-07-22.** New `apps/api/src/lib/crypto.ts` (AES-256-GCM
      encryptField/decryptField/isEncrypted, unified with auth.ts TOTP). students POST + CSV import
      now encrypt CNIC before store (NULL when blank); reveal-cnic decrypts (backward-compatible
      with legacy plaintext via isEncrypted). `scripts/backfill-cnic.mjs` (idempotent, --dry-run)
      encrypts existing plaintext rows. auth.ts TOTP refactored onto the shared crypto module.
      ⚠️ Founder: run backfill-cnic.mjs once against live DB after deploy.
- [x] FIXED 2026-07-22 (migration 009): `auth.ts` login/totp SELECT/UPDATE of
      `display_name, theme, language, totp_secret_enc, totp_backup_codes` — added the columns
      (renamed plaintext `totp_secret`→`totp_secret_enc`). Also caught `pdf-receipts.ts`
      SELECTing `h.tagline` (same class of runtime crash) → added `hostels.tagline`.
      ⚠️ Migration 009 must be applied to any live DB.
- [x] PARTIAL 2026-07-22: role 'super_admin' (not in users CHECK) removed from the 6
      `requireRole` guards in students.ts — was a dead literal that never matched. NOTE: those
      GET/POST/PATCH student routes still exclude `chain_manager` while import/reveal-cnic
      include it — an authorization-policy inconsistency for the owner to decide (add
      chain_manager to student read/write? left unchanged).
- [x] students.ts JSON-Schema validation — **DONE 2026-07-26** (`d892d11`, 7 tests green in CI).
      Params/querystring/body schemas on every route. Fixed three 500s-that-should-be-400s
      (`/students/not-a-uuid` → uuid cast failure; `?limit=abc` → `LIMIT NaN`; PATCH `status` →
      CHECK violation) and one guard wrong the other way: `!monthly_fee` rejected a fee of 0, so a
      scholarship/free bed could not be recorded — column is NUMERIC(10,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0.
      Status enum mirrors migration 002's CHECK. No `maximum` on limit on purpose: the handler
      already clamps to 100, and a 400 there would be a silent contract change for callers.
- [ ] DEFERRED (no code consumer yet — not adding dead schema): warden flags
      (`can_edit/can_delete/can_settings`) for DELETE-gating; hostel branding fields
      (`brand_color/show_branding/auto_month_advance`). Add with the feature that uses them.

